1
00:00:02,851 --> 00:00:06,966
I get up at seven o'clock every morning
我每天早上七点起床

2
00:00:07,972 --> 00:00:12,086
I brush my teeth and wash my face
我刷牙洗脸

3
00:00:13,332 --> 00:00:18,086
After I eat breakfast with my family
等我和家人吃完早餐

4
00:00:18,452 --> 00:00:21,847
I go to school and learn many things
我上学学了很多东西

5
00:00:22,891 --> 00:00:24,407
During recess
在休庭期间

6
00:00:25,172 --> 00:00:28,527
I play with my friends
我和我的朋友一起玩

7
00:00:28,931 --> 00:00:30,286
After school
放学后

8
00:00:30,652 --> 00:00:34,246
I go home and do my homework
我回家做作业

9
00:00:35,051 --> 00:00:36,447
In the evening
傍晚时分

10
00:00:37,012 --> 00:00:40,246
I eat dinner with my family
我和家人一起吃晚饭

11
00:00:40,411 --> 00:00:46,527
I start to sleep at nine o'clock to be ready for a new day
我九点开始睡觉为新的一天做好准备

